<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 29.84 to 6555.91.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.66 to 400.68.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.27.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1714 to 771.</p>
<p>Volume was 453,420,240 compared with 537,236,660 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
